# data/h1b holds 3.6GB of DOL source files (xlsx, datahub csv) that belong on
# S3, not in git -- but the small DERIVED artefacts are what the site actually
# publishes, and they were untracked too. That meant a change to a published
# number produced no diff and could not be rolled back. Track those.
